<title>USA: Labor Ready obtains $20 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready obtains $20 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc said Thursday it has obtained a a $20 million, two-year, accounts receivable revolving line of credit with U.S. Bank of Washington N.A.</p>
<p>This new revolving credit replaces the existing $10 million line presently in place with U.S. Bank.</p>
